# "Any number of target creatures" includes none (CR 601.2d, 115.1): with X = 2 and an Ornithopter to aim at, Bot1 may still
# choose no target (an empty Divide), and then no counters are put anywhere. The Adventure resolves and is exiled (CR 715.4).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Elusive Otter
Ornithopter
Forest x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Elusive Otter.Cast(X: 2; Ability: Adventure)
Bot1.Divide()
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Elusive Otter
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
